00:08:49.220 --> 00:08:52.550
about value and so on.

00:08:52.550 --> 00:08:57.220
And a group of scholars like Nancy Fraser

00:08:57.220 --> 00:09:02.220
or Titia Bhattacharya have
criticized Max's Capital

00:09:03.150 --> 00:09:06.760
and argue that capital
would be mainly concerned

00:09:06.760 --> 00:09:10.050
with the obstruct labor
