00:36:23.610 --> 00:36:26.410
and therefore assume their existence,

00:36:26.410 --> 00:36:30.560
that take it for granted
and live social reproduction

00:36:30.560 --> 00:36:32.350
out of the picture.

00:36:32.350 --> 00:36:37.350
And this kind of approach
fully criticized by Marx

00:36:38.040 --> 00:36:40.786
who starts from a completely
different point of view.

00:36:40.786 --> 00:36:44.000
And he argues, as we discussed earlier,

00:36:44.000 --> 00:36:46.760
by selling the liberal power workers

00:36:46.760 --> 00:36:50.640
are actually transferring onto Capital

00:36:50.640 --> 00:36:52.750
their entire productive power,

00:36:52.750 --> 00:36:55.320
including their reproductive power.

00:36:55.320 --> 00:36:58.780
And this kind of transfer
becomes even clear

00:36:58.780 --> 00:37:02.140
if we look at the process
of capital reproduction

00:37:02.140 --> 00:37:07.140
from a social point of view
and in its continuous flow,

00:37:07.580 --> 00:37:09.610
because if we do this,

00:37:09.610 --> 00:37:14.520
we see that throughout
the lives workers exchange

00:37:14.520 --> 00:37:17.430
with capital their entire liberal power.

00:37:17.430 --> 00:37:21.580
So the fact that capital
is buying it piece by piece

00:37:21.580 --> 00:37:25.993
instead of a mass like with the slave,

00:37:26.980 --> 00:37:30.630
it's actually a source of
precarity and dependence

00:37:30.630 --> 00:37:32.550
on the part of the worker,

00:37:32.550 --> 00:37:36.000
but the result is always a
condition of wage slavery,

00:37:36.000 --> 00:37:38.710
according to Marx.

00:37:38.710 --> 00:37:42.890
And so these shows that substantially

00:37:42.890 --> 00:37:46.700
there isn't a substantial
difference with slavery itself

00:37:46.700 --> 00:37:51.190
and the antagonism between
capital and wage labor

00:37:51.190 --> 00:37:54.780
also includes this fear
of life making activities

00:37:54.780 --> 00:37:56.770
and social needs.

00:37:56.770 --> 00:37:59.490
And the gender dimension
is of this antagonism

00:37:59.490 --> 00:38:02.830
between even clear from Marx
in the industrial period,

00:38:02.830 --> 00:38:07.160
when really he says the
labor of women and children

00:38:07.160 --> 00:38:11.030
was the first result of
the capitalist application

00:38:11.030 --> 00:38:14.871
of machinery and Marx
shows how this developed

00:38:14.871 --> 00:38:19.850
in complete antagonism with family labor

00:38:19.850 --> 00:38:23.823
and the social needs of
the workers at the time.

00:38:26.720 --> 00:38:31.540
Marx also shows that although
capitalism undermines

00:38:31.540 --> 00:38:34.810
the economic foundations
of the patriarchal family,

00:38:34.810 --> 00:38:39.630
it also relies on it to ensure
it's privatized reproduction,

00:38:39.630 --> 00:38:43.470
and these can worsen
patriarchal domination

00:38:43.470 --> 00:38:46.150
from some points of view,
but at the same time,

00:38:46.150 --> 00:38:48.880
it also empowers women and children

00:38:48.880 --> 00:38:51.940
and creates the conditions for overcoming

00:38:51.940 --> 00:38:55.960
the patriarchal division of
labor as part of the process

00:38:55.960 --> 00:38:59.243
of overthrowing capitalism itself.

00:39:01.040 --> 00:39:04.167
So of course, this brings me
to the question I anticipated

00:39:04.167 --> 00:39:09.167
of the class struggle according to Marx.

00:39:11.343 --> 00:39:15.120
It is also quite well known
that Marx puts forward quite

00:39:15.120 --> 00:39:18.700
an optimistic view at the
end of capital volume one,

00:39:18.700 --> 00:39:21.980
when he argues that the
development of capitalism,

00:39:21.980 --> 00:39:24.700
there is increasing class polarization

00:39:24.700 --> 00:39:28.020
and so the world of
the working class grows

00:39:28.020 --> 00:39:32.790
and these growing people
it's due to the fact

00:39:32.790 --> 00:39:36.650
that accumulation is due
to increase in cooperation,

00:39:36.650 --> 00:39:39.060
which is the basis of it.

00:39:39.060 --> 00:39:43.220
And the cooperation favors a
working class consciousness

00:39:43.220 --> 00:39:47.516
and organization and so
this process of cooperation

00:39:47.516 --> 00:39:52.500
actually creates the conditions
for the expropriation

00:39:52.500 --> 00:39:54.043
