for the care of older people

00:53:26.720 --> 00:53:28.870
and disabled people and so for a kind

00:53:28.870 --> 00:53:32.553
of sharing of the tasks
of social reproduction.

00:53:33.390 --> 00:53:38.390
And I just believe that
Mike's is a reflection

00:53:39.840 --> 00:53:44.840
